# Hotel AI — SEO agent

## Product context

Hotel AI is a digital room-service platform: QR-based guest ordering, public guest menu and services by hotel slug, kitchen/staff dashboards, and hotel admin (menu, rooms, settings). Legal pages target India (privacy/terms). Brand in metadata: "Hotel AI".

## Route taxonomy

| Segment | Examples | Indexing |
|---------|----------|----------|
| Marketing | `/`, future `/pricing` | **index** — strong titles, descriptions, OG |
| Legal | `/privacy`, `/terms` | **index** — unique metadata per page |
| Auth | `/login`, `/register`, `/forgot-password`, `/verify-email/*` | **noindex** (or minimal metadata) |
| Admin / staff | `/dashboard`, `/orders`, `/menu`, `/kitchen`, `/rooms`, `/settings`, … | **noindex, nofollow** via `(admin)` server layout |
| Superadmin | `/superadmin/**` | **noindex** |
| Guest (tenant) | `/menu/[hotelSlug]`, `/services/[hotelSlug]` | Default **noindex** for privacy; if product requires discoverable menus, index + unique `generateMetadata` per hotel |

## Next.js App Router patterns

- Use `export const metadata` or `generateMetadata` for every new **public** route.
- Set **`metadataBase`** from `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` (absolute URLs for `openGraph.images` and canonicals).
- Add **`openGraph`** and **`twitter`** (card, title, description) for pages meant to be shared.
- Use **`title.template`** on root layout: e.g. `%s | Hotel AI` for child titles.
- **JSON-LD**: only when accurate — e.g. `Organization` / `WebSite` on marketing; do not use `LocalBusiness` without a real public address.
- Guest slug routes: use **`robots: { index: false, follow: false }`** unless product explicitly indexes tenant menus.

## SEO pass checklist

When the user asks for an SEO review or pass:

1. Unique `<title>` and meta description per indexable URL.
2. Single logical **H1** per page; heading hierarchy sensible.
3. Images: meaningful **`alt`**; prefer `next/image` for LCP where applicable.
4. Internal links from landing to key flows (login, legal).
5. No duplicate thin content across slugs without canonical strategy.
6. Core Web Vitals: avoid huge unoptimized hero assets; lazy-load below fold.

## Out of scope for generic marketing SEO

API routes, `src/app/api/**`, blob uploads, impersonation tokens — keep **noindex**; do not expose sensitive data in meta tags.

## File references

- Root metadata: `hotel-ai-frontend/src/app/layout.tsx`
- Robots / sitemap: `hotel-ai-frontend/src/app/robots.ts`, `sitemap.ts`
- Admin crawl policy: `hotel-ai-frontend/src/app/(admin)/layout.tsx` (server) + `AdminShell.tsx`
- Guest menu metadata: `hotel-ai-frontend/src/app/(guest)/menu/[hotelSlug]/page.tsx`
- Guest services: `hotel-ai-frontend/src/app/(guest)/services/[hotelSlug]/layout.tsx` + client page
